<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1239"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxtrotnem<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxtrotnem<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, October 15, 2004 - 11:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->they also made up flyers showing the front of her house and it says something to the effect of if you drove by this house on 254 hiway from like 1230 to 130 in the afternoon please call butler county sheriff dept and they posted them out all over the butler county community college. i think this is wierd. i wonder if they think she was murdered by a college student. i also think that her husband may be the same professor mould that teaches sex education at butler county community college.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
