</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, October 18, 2004 - 7:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/eagle/news/local/crime_courts/8411738.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/eagle/news/local/crime_c ourts/8411738.htm</a> <BR> <BR>Oct. 25, 1980: Barbara A. Smith, 37, was found beaten to death in her home at 1151 S. Waverly. There was no sign of forced entry. The killer set two small fires in the kitchen that burned themselves out.  <BR> <BR>this is link i posted on another thread, i should have posted it here as well, sorry all. <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
