<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1410"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, November 10, 2004 - 5:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Does anyone know if Doug Mould&#39;s father was a minister? Just curious. Looking at family backgrounds can often lend insights and/or eliminate lines of thinking. Thanks.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
